\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/20260806_Peanut_candy_at_He_Ji_Huasheng_Tang.jpg/500px-20260806_Peanut_candy_at_He_Ji_Huasheng_Tang.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"4096\" data-file-height=\"3072\" /></a></span><div class=\"infobox-caption\">芝麻花生糖</div></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header\" style=\"border: 1px solid #FFCC99; background-color: #FFCC9940;;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80%E9%9D%9E%E7%89%A9%E8%B3%AA%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%E9%81%BA%E7%94%A2%E6%B8%85%E5%96%AE\" title=\"澳門非物質文化遺產清單\">澳門非物質文化遺產清單</a></th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;;\">分類</th><td class=\"infobox-data category\" style=\"\">傳統手工藝技能</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;;\">序號</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\">87</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"white-space: nowrap;;\">認定時間</th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\">2026年</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-full-data\" style=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.culturalheritage.mo/detail/102982\">詳細資料</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>花生糖</b>，部分地區稱<b>豆仁糖</b>、<b>土豆糖</b>，是一種用花生及糖混和做成的甜品，在<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%86\" title=\"中國大陸\">中國大陸</a>、台灣、<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%AC%A7\" title=\"西歐\">西歐</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD\" title=\"美國\">美國</a>都甚為常見，花生糖是將<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F\" title=\"花生\">花生</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96\" title=\"麥芽糖\">麥芽糖</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A0%82%E7%B3%96\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"砂糖\">砂糖</a>混合加熱至濃稠狀態，冷卻凝固後切成小塊所製成。早期的花生糖的主材料與做法極為單純，近年來已衍生出多種製作方法，例如花生軟糖、花生酥糖；或添加各種副材料以創造多變化的口味，例如<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8A%9D%E9%BA%BB\" title=\"芝麻\">芝麻</a>花生糖等。\n</p><p>另有以<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9D%8F%E4%BB%81\" title=\"杏仁\">杏仁</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A0%B8%E6%A1%83\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"核桃\">核桃</a>、<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E7%93%9C%E5%AD%90&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"南瓜子（頁面不存在）\">南瓜子</a>等乾果取代花生，即各自稱呼為杏仁糖、核桃糖、南瓜子糖等。\n</p><p>在<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF\" title=\"香港\">香港</a>，以<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B9%9D%E9%BE%8D%E5%9F%8E%E5%8D%80\" title=\"九龍城區\">九龍城區</a>潮汕餅食店的花生最馳名。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"花生軟糖\"><span id=\".E8.8A.B1.E7.94.9F.E8.BB.9F.E7.B3.96\"></span>花生軟糖</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：花生軟糖\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>花生軟糖的製作過程是將精選之花生清洗後，與適量的麥芽糖、植物油等混合後，經數十分鐘的高溫煉煮，直至花生酥軟，與糖完全混合為止，再經切割、包裝，即成一包包便攜的花生軟糖。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"图集\"><span id=\".E5.9B.BE.E9.9B.86\"></span>圖集</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：圖集\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dominion-Peanut-Bar-Split.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"花生糖\"><img alt=\"花生糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Dominion-Peanut-Bar-Split.jpg/120px-Dominion-Peanut-Bar-Split.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Dominion-Peanut-Bar-Split.jpg/250px-Dominion-Peanut-Bar-Split.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"3400\" data-file-height=\"1180\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">花生糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96%E8%A3%BD%E4%BD%9C_1.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"花生糖製作\"><img alt=\"花生糖製作\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96%E8%A3%BD%E4%BD%9C_1.jpg/120px-%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96%E8%A3%BD%E4%BD%9C_1.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96%E8%A3%BD%E4%BD%9C_1.jpg/250px-%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E9%BA%A5%E8%8A%BD%E7%B3%96%E8%A3%BD%E4%BD%9C_1.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"6000\" data-file-height=\"4000\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">花生糖製作</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:KDV_purple_sugar_(1).jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"紫皮糖，巧克力裹花生糖\"><img alt=\"紫皮糖，巧克力裹花生糖\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/KDV_purple_sugar_%281%29.jpg/120px-KDV_purple_sugar_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/KDV_purple_sugar_%281%29.jpg/250px-KDV_purple_sugar_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2448\" data-file-height=\"2448\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">紫皮糖，巧克力裹花生糖</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參見\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.A6.8B\"></span>參見</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%8A%B1%E7%94%9F%E7%B3%96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參見\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173149\">.mw-parser-output .side-box{margin:4px 0;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #aaa;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em;background-color:#f9f9f9;display:flow-root}.mw-parser-output .side-box-abovebelow,.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{padding:0.25em 0.9em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.9em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-imageright{padding:2px 0.9em 2px 0;text-align:center}@media(min-width:500px){.mw-parser-output .side-box-flex{display:flex;align-items:center}.mw-parser-output .side-box-text{flex:1}}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .side-box{width:238px}.mw-parser-output .side-box-right{clear:right;float:right;margin-left:1em}.mw-parser-output .side-box-left{margin-right:1em}}</style><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173201\">@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .sistersitebox{display:none!important}}</style><div class=\"side-box side-box-right plainlinks sistersitebox\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173195\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style>\n<div class=\"side-box-flex\">\n<div class=\"side-box-image\"><span class=\"noviewer\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Commons-logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/60px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1376\" /></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"side-box-text plainlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BB%B4%E5%9F%BA%E5%85%B1%E4%BA%AB%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90\" title=\"維基共享資源\">維基共享資源</a>上的相關多媒體資源：<a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Seed_brittles\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"commons:Category:Seed brittles\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">花生糖</span></a></div></div>\n</div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%A3%A2%E4%B8%89%E5%AF%B6\" title=\"中壢三寶\">中壢三寶</a>：花生酥糖為<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%87%BA%E7%81%A3\" title=\"臺灣\">臺灣</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A1%83%E5%9C%92%E5%B8%82\" title=\"桃園市\">桃園市</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%AD%E5%A3%A2%E5%8D%80\" title=\"中壢區\">中壢區</a>之特產。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E6%96%97%E9%8E%AE_(%E5%8F%B0%E7%81%A3)#美食\" title=\"北斗鎮 (台灣)\">北斗三大名產</a>：肉圓、肉乾、酥糖，其中酥糖即花生糖。</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%94%9F%E4%BB%81%E7%B3%96\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"生仁糖\">生仁糖</a>：也叫<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%AC%E8%B1%86\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"天公豆\">天公豆</a>，外皮包覆紅色或白色糖漿的花生，通常會與<a href=\"https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E5%AF%B8%E6%A3%97\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikt:寸棗\">寸棗</a>放一起用於祭祀活動，例如<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8E%A5%E7%A5%9E%E6%97%A5\" title=\"接神日\">接神日</a>。</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐75b8b7cc49‐2f4bm\nCached time: 20261028043146\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.210 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.280 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 537/1000000\nRevision 